    "updated_at": "2018-11-21T16:41:48Z",
    "body": "There are no plans to allow a page to get access to a device by MAC address without asking the user for permission the way that the Android API allows. We can however consider adding the MAC address as a filterable device property so that it is the only device available for the user to select (assuming that it is in range and appears at all).",
