    "body": "The MAC addresses Chrome displays for devices on macOS are artificial. If you compare them to what is displayed on other platforms you will find they do not match. The [macOS Bluetooth API](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/corebluetooth/cbpeer) only provides a UUID to represent the device, not the MAC address.",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
