    "updated_at": "2020-01-15T20:45:26Z",
    "body": "That's for the clarity.   I didn't realize it was fake at first glance.  I was just happy to see numbers :).   So using the manufacturer filter would be the best option long term.  Hopefully that stabilizes soon.\r\n\r\n",
